    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n26978" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δῐ-κόρῠφος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>two-peaked,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δ. πλάξ,</span> of Parnassus, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Ba.</u>
				307
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λάμπουσα πέτρα . . δ. σέλας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Ph.</u>
					227
				</span></i>
			 (lyr.); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κλειτύς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Limen.
					2
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>with two crowns,</i> of the hair on the head, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>HA</u>
				491b7
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Poll.
				2.43
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>with two tops,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐνθέματα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Gp.</u>
					10.75.7
				</span></i>
			.</div>
